Scope of this license

The MIT License above covers the code in modelo/ (the Python scripts) and its outputs in modelo/resultados/.

The manuscript and the supplementary material (manuscript.pdf, supplementary_material.pdf) are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

modelo/datos_fuente/ contains excerpts of NIST Standard Reference Data (NIST-JANAF Thermochemical Tables; NIST
Chemistry WebBook), redistributed with attribution for reproducibility. They are not covered by the MIT License; their
terms are those of NIST.
